---
// Google Client ID Config Modal
---

<div id="googleClientIdModal" class="modal-backdrop fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/40 flex items-end sm:items-center justify-center p-0 sm:p-4">
  <div class="modal-panel bg-white w-full sm:max-w-md rounded-t-lg sm:rounded-lg border border-hairline-strong shadow-flat-overlay overflow-hidden">
    
    <div class="p-4 border-b border-hairline flex items-center justify-between bg-canvas-soft">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider">Pengaturan Google Client ID</h3>
      <button type="button" class="btn-close-clientid-modal text-muted hover:text-ink text-base p-1">✕</button>
    </div>

    <div class="p-5 space-y-3">
      <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
        Masukkan Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID dari Google Cloud Console jika ingin menggunakan kredensial kustom Anda sendiri.
      </p>

      <div>
        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-body mb-1">Google OAuth Client ID</label>
        <textarea
          id="inputGoogleClientId"
          rows="3"
          placeholder="xxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com"
          class="w-full p-2.5 text-xs bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline-strong rounded-xs text-ink focus:outline-none focus:border-primary font-mono"
        ></textarea>
      </div>

      <p class="text-[11px] text-muted">
        Biarkan default jika menggunakan konfigurasi bawaan aplikasi CatatUang.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 bg-canvas-soft border-t border-hairline flex items-center justify-end gap-2">
      <button type="button" class="btn-close-clientid-modal btn-soft px-4 py-2 text-xs uppercase">Batal</button>
      <button type="button" id="btnSaveGoogleClientId" class="btn-spruce px-5 py-2 text-xs uppercase">Simpan</button>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
